    q: 'Which forensic science career option pays the best in India?',
    a: 'Forensic accounting and fraud examination and digital/cyber forensics currently lead on pay, because both sit largely in the private sector (advisory firms, banks, fintechs, cybersecurity companies) rather than on a fixed government pay scale. A senior forensic accountant or CFE at a Big-4 advisory practice, or a senior digital forensic consultant, can reach Rs 18-30+ LPA, well past what the government FSL ladder pays at an equivalent career stage.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is forensic science the same as forensic biology or DNA analysis?',
    a: 'No. Forensic biology/DNA and serology is only one of the eight real tracks inside forensic science, though it is the one most people picture first because of crime shows. Digital forensics, forensic accounting, toxicology, ballistics, questioned documents, psychology, and anthropology are separate, distinct specialisations with different degrees, employers, and career ladders.',
  },
